    "rating": 4.9,
    "reference": "ChIJ6Xd9SyVIyUwRgktlhMLKwk0",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Shari Colbon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108226690065225245276/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU_sY3VuVmg6g9yEknPh5Mtk4gRVhbtb6zi6I8MopKaAskfs9a-yA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Had our first cleaning today, very impressed. The communication beforehand was great. Knew exactly when they were coming. They were a team of 3, super nice, hard working ladies. Loved the checklist after the cleaning as well. Very professional. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1769028754,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrew Laramee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115664713202649926445/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWadnzzuoQYh2ksS1dmWRB94mmAmX03GqZV7lF3nHg7nY3qcDv5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I had a very unfortunate experience getting my house cleaned by this company. The employees were respectful enough but the cleaning job was completely inadequate. And this was after a price increase once they assessed that there was \"more dust\" than expected.\n\nThey did a terrible job vacuuming stairs and carpets. Their excuse was that their vacuum wasn't strong enough.\nThey didn't return things to where they were previously\nThey broke one of the light fixtures in the kitchen\nThey completely ignored certain dusty areas and did a bad job dusting others\n\nI raised the issue with the company and they admitted it was not anywhere close to their standards and offered to send another team to finish the job. Unfortunately the timing did not work and after some negotiation they gave me an unsatisfactory discount. I paid almost $600 to get 2 floors of a small house cleaned and I spent 2 hours finishing the job myself afterwards.\n\nTo the owner's response:\n\nFirst off, I do not appreciate the slanderous accusation that you noted any recurring pattern in my review history. It's all public and easy to see that I write factual and respectful reviews that mirror my experiences with different companies and yours, unfortunately, did a bad job. You should work on how you handle this in the future.\n\nI don't doubt other people's satisfaction and I'm happy for them but the service you provided in my situation was not anywhere close to adequate and you immediately admitted to it in a response email (which is why I prefer to keep communication of disputes in writing).\n\nThe reason I paid is because it was clear we had reached an impass in negotiation and I no longer wanted to deal with you.\n\nWhen your employee broke the light fixture she apologized and I passed it off as a mistake, but she did still break it.\n\nWhen I asked about all of the hair still present on my carpet and stairs your employee did in fact mention that the she had vacuumed, but it wasn't working very well.\n\nI hope all of your future clients have a better experience than I did. Have a good day.",
        "time": 1750355638,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Erika Young",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105763709137311458109/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJTKAmb3ihamKYLGiJiormsnAgfk2rEQp7qsDlDydD5BggS6w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Serena and Denise were friendly and extremely thorough with our move-in cleaning. They worked quickly and were happy to do a walk through after to go over all the details. Would highly recommend their services, it makes the moving process so much easier. Thank you, ladies !",
        "time": 1765478620,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lynn Lapointe",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100534855899332985990/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKMZd8bpP0E7B50op7XklLfK2u_oJdLKahAv-nr91C6XGCL-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "We used their services this week and were very satisfied. Extremely good customer service, thank you Peter for your patience! The team did great work. Would not hesitate to recommend them.",
        "time": 1763756379,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Psalm 119 105",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117471027887291127107/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVA5hVSCnbGWCciweSslZTbdhhSVRjH5Epq7uli-dJZuAl0XQY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I had the absolute pleasure of having Serena and Denise from Clean on the Go deep clean my condo, and I couldn't be happier with the results! They were incredibly attentive to every detail, leaving no corner untouched. My entire space looks fabulous — it's sparkling clean and feels brand new.  The oven cleaning add-on was also 100% worth it — I can’t believe how spotless the interior looks now. Serena and Denise were also extremely professional, punctual, and pleasant. If you're thinking about booking a deep clean, don’t hesitate — I highly recommend Serena and Denise. They went above and beyond, and I’ll definitely be booking them again!",
        "time": 1757348536,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
